          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You're exceptionally difficult to kill. The DC of your recovery checks is equal to 9 + your dying value, or 8 + your dying value if you have the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Toughness] general feat. In addition, whenever someone returns you to life using magic that would normally leave you debilitated for a week (such as @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Raise Dead] or the resurrect ritual), you don't suffer that condition.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 5
